OL,3,GNEWSANo slowing down for sweetmaker
OL,4,A'Toffee Ron'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular confectioner from Wigan,
OL,7,Fwhose family have been handcrafting
OL,8,Fsweets in the town for more than a
OL,9,Fcentury, said he has no plans of
OL,10,Fslowing down.
OL,12,FRon Westhead, 73, known as "Toffee
OL,13,FRon", learnt the almost forgotten art
OL,14,Fof sweet making as a 14-year-old
OL,15,Fapprentice.
OL,17,FUsing homemade machinery, he makes and
OL,18,Fsells traditional favourites, including
OL,19,Fpear drops and 'curley aniseed' from
OL,20,Fthe town's Victorian Makinson Arcade.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
